      "height": 160,
      "color": "#361415",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. Pruning (Early Termination)\nThe most crucial optimization. Continuously check constraints as the partial solution is being built. If adding a choice makes the current path invalid, stop exploring that path immediately. This significantly reduces the search space.\nExample: In N-Queens, checking for conflicts after placing each queen. If a conflict exists, don't try placing more queens in that partial board configuration.",
      "zIndex": 6
    },
